(1001,'107',NULL,'333','22',NULL,NULL,'33',NULL,'777',NULL,'/','SC-PMU101','高效率降压转换器','VQFN (RHA)',40,5000,1,1,'<p>一款用于便携设备的同步降压转换器。</p>',NULL,'[\"http://localhost:8000/uploads/527e061e663fcd961feec229f3e8f25c.png\", \"http://localhost:8000/uploads/2a7d3d65c8bbe41ff13d673a3620879d.png\", \"http://localhost:8000/uploads/4d0e97161d3fad1ea8d1da2c55914f56.png\"]',NULL,NULL,'0',1,132,0,'2025-11-12 11:22:58','2026-06-11 14:20:27','SC1001',5,'PMU101',NULL,NULL,NULL,100,NULL,0.55,'USD',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,101,202,NULL,22.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'宽电源电压范围：8V 至 85V\n高输出电流：350mA\n低噪声：10kHz 时为 6nV/√Hz\n高带宽：10MHz GBW\n高压摆率：40V/µs\n低失调电压：±50µV\n低失调电压漂移：±1µV/°C\n轨到轨输出\n禁用功能\n静态电流：启用：3.25mA禁用：250µA\n过热和过流标志\n温度范围：-40°C 至 +125°C\n要获得更高的直流精度，请选择 OPA593'),
