(1313,'en-US','红酒应存放在阴凉、避光、湿度适中的环境中，最佳温度为12-18℃，平放或斜放以保持瓶塞湿润。','Red wine should be stored in a cool, dark, and moderately humid environment, with an optimum temperature of 12-18 degrees Celsius. Lay it flat or diagonally to keep the cork moist.','faq',3,'answer',1,1,'zh-CN','2026-05-26 07:37:38','2026-05-26 07:37:38',2),
