(1679,'en-US','天启芯采用国际领先的GPP芯片生产工艺和先进的SMD封装技术，为客户提供高性价比的全系列二极管、三极管产品。','Tianqi core adopts the international leading GPP chip production process and advanced SMD packaging technology to provide customers with a full range of cost-effective diode and transistor products.','ui',0,'text',1,1,'zh-CN','2026-05-26 13:10:42','2026-05-26 13:10:42',2),
